   "reference": "quadratic dynamic programme over prefix lengths, trying every last-shipment start and computing its maximum directly",
   "candidate_design": "a shipment ending at i is balanced exactly when it starts at or before g(i), the nearest earlier index with a larger weight (monotonic stack); best[i + 1] = 1 + max(best[0..g(i)]), using a running prefix maximum of best",
